READ THIS FIRST - WHAT THIS REPOSITORY IS
================================================================================
This repository is HIVE Limited, a deliberately LIMITED demonstration build.

It is NOT HIVE. The full HIVE engine - its batch and serving paths, its compiler
toolchain, its kernel research record, and its ongoing work - is not published
here and is not licensed by this file. HIVE Limited is a governed build: it is
restricted by OMISSION, and the omitted material is proprietary and unpublished.

Nothing in this repository should be represented as the performance, capability,
or architecture of HIVE.
================================================================================

